Vanilla recipe, item/block-tag, and loot snapshot
==========================================

`src/vanillaCatalog.ts`, `src/vanillaItemTags.ts`, `src/vanillaBlockTags.ts`,
`src/vanillaLoot.ts`, and the engine-gap dump modules (`src/vanillaItemTagDump.ts`,
`src/vanillaBlockTagDump.ts`, `src/vanillaLootDump.ts`)
contain Minecraft Bedrock recipe, tag, and loot data derived from Mojang's public
bedrock-samples / vanilla-tags dumps and from in-engine reads of the same game
(see `VANILLA_CATALOG_MINECRAFT` in vanillaCatalog.ts).

